  "releaseNotes": "## 2.0.5 - 2026-11-11\n\n- Streams published API result extraction on the server. A model that continues producing text or reasoning can finish beyond 60 seconds; connection and inactivity are bounded separately.\n- Retries interrupted extractions without rerunning the business task. A truncated result can retry with a larger token budget; explicitly non-streaming providers use a bounded compatibility request.\n- Delivers a successful callback only after the complete JSON passes the published schema. Reuses Runtime 1.0.0 and existing sandbox templates.",
